title: 'FIXED: the Oracle lies-green bug (T-2026-06-25-001) — gitReality.conflicted now gates the verdict'
summary: 'Fixed the critical trust bug the team found firsthand in the CLI battle-test: oracle/weave reported CONVERGENT/score 1/CLEAN TO WEAVE while git reality was CONFLICT, because a conflict in a non-symbol file (README.md) or the WORKTREE pseudo-ref mapped to no symbol and the `conflicted` boolean never reached the verdict. Now mapConflicts() surfaces unmapped conflict paths and score() counts them (+ the indeterminate no-paths case) as git-only divergences → DIVERGENT, never green. Verified firsthand: `oracle WORKTREE main` → DIVERGENT (was CONVERGENT/score 1). 4 new guards; 110 tests pass.'
